==Pirate Raid==
{{Main|Pirate Raid}}
The '''[[Pirate Raid]]''' is an event only found in the [[Third Sea]] and happens every 1 hour and 15 minutes (75 minutes). During this event, a horde of non-boss enemies from [[First Sea]] and [[Second Sea]] will start spawning. A tanky enemy will spawn as the final enemy and has more HP than the other Pirates, hence the name. Whoever deals the final blow to the tanky enemy will get a random fruit. Any player that has defeated at least one Pirate, will get {{Fragment|100}} after all enemies are defeated.

==Raids==
{{Main|Raids}}
Players can do [[raids]] in [[Third Sea]], and they can be found at the Castle on the Sea. Just like in the [[Second Sea]], the [[Mysterious Scientist]] is also here for a player to buy/trade [[microchip]]s.

==rip_indra True Form==
{{Main|rip_indra True Form}}
'''rip_indra True Form''' is a Lv. 5000 [[Raid Bosses|Raid Boss]] that can be spawned by pressing the [[Skins|Aura Color]] buttons on the island with their corresponding '''{{Legendary}}''' [[Skins|Aura color]]. After all the buttons are pressed, the player must place the [[God's Chalice]] on the pedestal located to the right of the entrance.

