==Portals==
{{Main|Portals}}
There are three [[portals]] available in the Castle on the Sea

* The left orange portal is linked to [[Tiki Outpost]].
* The middle portal is linked to the [[Mansion (Third Sea)|Mansion]] in [[Floating Turtle]].
* The right portal is linked to [[Hydra Island]].

In order to access the Mansion and Hydra Island [[portals]], the player must have defeated [[rip_indra True Form]] at least once.

To access the [[Tiki Outpost]] portal, the player must have defeated [[Tyrant of the Skies|Tyrant Of The Skies]] at least once.

