* When [[Rip indra True Form|rip_indra true form]] is summoned, the island is temporarily renamed to "''[[Battle of the Gods|Battle of the Gods"]].''
* Using [[Control]]’s old '''[X] Levitate''' could levitate one of these castles. The reworked '''[C] Gamma Blade''' can cut the same towers, although cannot levitate them.
